## Key Concepts

- Avro schema evolution and Schema Registry for managing schema versions
- Backward and forward compatibility in distributed data pipelines
- Zero-downtime migrations with phased rollout strategies
- Data backfill techniques and drift detection
- Producer/consumer tolerance for handling both old and new field representations
- Circuit breaking and canary deployments for safe migration

